/given-names></name><name><surname>Miyaji</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Imai</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Schreiber</surname><given-names>AZ</given-names></name><name><surname>Moretti</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Diagnosis of candidemia by polymerase chain reaction and blood culture: prospective study in a high-risk population and identification of variables associated with development of candidemia</article-title><source>Eur J Clin Microbiol Infect Dis</source><year>2005</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>721</fpage><lpage>726</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16328556</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10096-005-0041-7</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Odabasi</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Mattiuzzi</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Estey</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Kantarjian</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Saeki</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Ridge</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ketchum</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Finkelman</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Rex</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ostrosky-Zeichner</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Beta-D-glucan as a diagnostic adjunct for invasive fungal infections: validation, cutoff development, and performance in patients with acute myelogenous leukemia and myelodysplastic syndrome</article-title><source>Clin Infect Dis</source><year>2004</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>199</fpage><lpage>205</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15307029</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1086/421944</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><c